{"id":13530,"author":"lactify","body":"Hey you! Yeah you, the one who is reading this thread. You need a team right? Well you have come to the right place. Join the FIREYFLAMES team today!\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eRequirements:\u003cbr\u003eMust have at least 2 days of Avicus server playtime\u003cbr\u003eMust enable to communicate. (Skype is not a 100% needed requirement but I have to be able to communicate with you somehow.\u003cbr\u003eMust be fairly active on the server.\u003cbr\u003eMust have a good attitude towards other players.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eFORMAT:\u003cbr\u003eName\u003cbr\u003eAge\u003cbr\u003eDo you have Skype or access to TeamSpeak?\u003cbr\u003eFavourite map? (This won't affect your chances)\u003cbr\u003eMinecraft Username:\u003cbr\u003eWhat is your best position? (Rush, Midfield or Defender)\u003cbr\u003eWhy you want to join us?\u003cbr\u003eRate yourself out of 10 with a sword\u003cbr\u003eRate yourself out of 10 with a bow and arrow\u003cbr\u003eEver has a best game before? (This won't affect your chances)\u003cbr\u003eTimezone\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003ePlease stick to this application format or you may be DENIED! Apply below by writing your application down in the comments section. Good luck!\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eIf you have any further questions, please don't hesitate to contact me.\u003cbr\u003eContacting me via Skype: marcuzfire346\u003cbr\u003eContacting me via email: mpmarcuzfire@gmail.com","body_tagged":"Hey you! Yeah you, the one who is reading this thread. You need a team right? Well you have come to the right place. Join the FIREYFLAMES team today!\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eRequirements:\u003cbr\u003eMust have at least 2 days of Avicus server playtime\u003cbr\u003eMust enable to communicate. (Skype is not a 100% needed requirement but I have to be able to communicate with you somehow.\u003cbr\u003eMust be fairly active on the server.\u003cbr\u003eMust have a good attitude towards other players.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u